The shopping cart computes its subtotal by iterating over each item in the cart and summing up the product of the item's price in cents and its quantity. This is done in the `subtotalCents` method of the `Cart` class [2]. Here is the relevant code snippet:

```typescript
/** Sum of price x quantity in cents, before discounts, tax and shipping. */
subtotalCents(): number {
  let total = 0;
  for (const line of this.lines.values()) {
    total += line.product.price_cents * line.quantity;
  }
  return total;
}
```
